<title>CHINA: China June soy products import, export totals.</title>
<headline>China June soy products import, export totals.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's imports and exports of</p>
<p>soybean, soymeal and soyoil as reported in official customs</p>
<p>figures (percentage change for January-June 1997 compared with</p>
<p>the same period last year):</p>
<p>		JUNE IMPORTS  JAN-JUNE IMPORTS	  VS PVS YEAR</p>
<p> Soybean	112,297	    1,240,561	    N/A  PERCENT</p>
<p> Soyoil	  54,392		520,522	   -18.0</p>
<p> Soymeal	 51,487	    1,201,034	    N/A</p>
<p>(Note: all figures in tonnes)</p>
<p>		  JUNE EXPORTS     JAN-JUNE EXPORTS   VS PVS YEAR</p>
<p> Soybean	 14,413		115,197	    N/A  PERCENT</p>
<p> Soyoil	   2,091		 16,306	  +1,974.0</p>
<p> Soymeal	  1,624		 14,380	    N/A</p>
<p>(Note: all figures in tonnes)</p>
<p>--Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
